cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this package, please cite the associated manuscript; while it is
  under review, cite this archive.
title: >-
  Replication package for "Recognition as Eligibility: County-Seat Proximity
  and Access to Conservation Support Arrangements in China's Traditional
  Villages"
abstract: >-
  Scripts, coordinate-free derived data, adjudication records and frozen result
  logs reproducing every number reported in the associated manuscript. Village
  coordinates are not redistributed; they must be obtained from the cited
  spatial dataset and re-run through the included scripts.
type: software
